  "scope": "Share generated near-target isolation proofs across two geometries and update generator",
  "validation": "Paired geometry, certificate and GapSource builds pass, followed by eight paired adopted kernel and wrapper builds; independent regeneration is byte-identical. 157 common public reports, 31,715 global simp entries and 13,981 instance entries match.",
  "limitations": [
    "The new public helper and two generated auxiliaries are exposed through existing imports; four public generated and two private generated proof names disappear. No tracked project Lean/tool references were found.",
    "Historical project and external/Foundation inputs remain cached; the rebuilt direct-provider chain is not a clean full closure. The preliminary GapCertificate objects were overwritten by fresh replays and are retained only as historical receipts.",
    "The first smoke import and intermediate generator misclassification were superseded; their original raw outputs or sources were not retained.",
    "Concurrent build timings are not a controlled benchmark. Archives omit compiled objects and require original paths/toolchain for replay."
  ],
